          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "TS29.281 figure 5.1-1, **Note 4**, _this field shall be present if and of any one or more of the S, PN and E flags are set_. With this note I would say we shall always print Sequence number (even if Note 1 say \"shall only be evaluated when indicated by the S flag\"), hence can be moved outside `if (gtp_hdr->flags & GTP_S_MASK)`",
